  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_1_7256" name="Here's the transition sentence:&#10;&#10;&quot;With the supplier officially onboarded and contract execution underway, the process triggers the decision of whether goods require shipment, initiating the secretary's clarification of shipping arrangements and subsequent logistics coordination.&quot; &#10;&#10;This sentence logically bridges the two processes by:&#10;1. Referencing the outcome of Process A (supplier onboarding/contract execution)&#10;2. Identifying the conditional trigger for Process B (&quot;whether goods require shipment&quot;)&#10;3. Connecting roles (procurement → secretary) and outcomes (contract execution → shipping decisions)" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_1" sourceRef="atom_0_Task_3" targetRef="Bridge_1_7256" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_1" sourceRef="Bridge_1_7256" targetRef="atom_1_ParallelGateway_1" /><bpmn:userTask id="atom_2_UserTask_1" name="Query the next shop">
